		"name": "ProxyAPI - Complete Collection (Updated)",
		"description": "✅ UPDATED - Complete API collection for ProxyAPI\n\n📦 Includes:\n• Authentication (OTP, JWT)\n• Products (with Image & IsActive fields)\n• Variants (with key statistics)\n• CD Keys (Bulk Add with Duplicate Detection)\n• ⭐ Sold Keys (NEW - Track sales with user info)\n• Dashboard Statistics\n• User Management\n\n🆕 New Features:\n✅ Product statistics aggregation\n✅ Bulk key addition\n✅ Automatic duplicate detection\n✅ Sold keys tracking with filters\n✅ Search and date range filtering\n\n🚀 Base URL: https://api.realproxy.store\n📅 Updated: December 2024",
